{"ID":"20240205153842-viav11n","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153842-viav11n","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153842-viav11n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100915-y0ljie7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613111225-jius1f3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:982,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613111707-7fpxu3a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"302连翘","type":"doc","updated":"20240826085130"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206100915-y0ljie7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100915-y0ljie7","updated":"20240206100922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、山西、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t黄翘：呈长卵形或卵形，两端狭尖，多分裂为两瓣。表面有一条明显的纵沟和不规则的纵皱纹及凸起小斑点，间有残留果柄，表面棕黄色，内面浅黄棕色，平滑，内有纵隔。质坚脆。种子多已脱落。气微香，味苦。\n青翘：呈狭卵形至卵形，两端狭尖，多不开裂。表面青绿色，绿褐色，有两条纵沟和凸起小斑点，内有纵隔。质坚硬。气芳香，味苦。间有残留果柄。\n【品质】\t黄翘以色黄、瓣大、壳厚者为佳。\n\t\t青翘以色绿、不开裂者为佳。\n【性味】\t苦、微寒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，消肿散结，疏散风热，有“疮家圣药”之称。治温热，丹毒，斑疹，痈疡肿毒，瘰疬，小便淋闭，清心火。"}]},{"ID":"20240206100916-2j4fl7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100916-2j4fl7v","updated":"20240206100916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100916-2w9x6kp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155729-ltlubed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155729-ltlubed","updated":"20240205155729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连翘"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连翘-20240205155729-tb6a8ql.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826085130-ltb2gun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826085130-ltb2gun","updated":"20240826085130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 461px;","style":"width: 451px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连翘 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连翘 9-20240826085130-58athr7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 451px;\" parent-style=\"width: 461px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826083923-vqk9fwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826083923-vqk9fwv","updated":"20240826084119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 305px;","style":"width: 295px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连翘"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连翘-20240826083923-z6mrldk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 295px;\" parent-style=\"width: 305px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 518px;","style":"width: 508px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连翘 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连翘 1-20240826084027-lrz7seq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 508px;\" parent-style=\"width: 518px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 299px;","style":"width: 289px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连翘 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连翘 2-20240826084119-td7fho1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 289px;\" parent-style=\"width: 299px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240701150755-m8kxgjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701150755-m8kxgjz","updated":"20240826084229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 636px;","style":"width: 626px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连翘1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连翘1-20240701150755-5u9atqw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 626px;\" parent-style=\"width: 636px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连翘 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连翘 3-20240826084229-g5srh6m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717184305-yz7f96t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717184305-yz7f96t","updated":"20240826084255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"连翘"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/连翘-20240717184305-u9p3dto.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeIma